{"seq":1,"slug":"multiplayer-cursors","title":"多人光标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/multiplayer-cursors","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"多人光标\">多人光标</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多人光标是协作应用中最直观的功能——实时看到其他用户的光标让产品感觉&quot;鲜活&quot;。Figma 于 2016 年推广了这一模式，Google Docs 随后加入，Notion、Linear 跟进，Liveblocks 提供 React hooks 让实现变得简单。设计多人光标需要考虑：光标颜色（区分用户）、姓名标签、平滑动画、性能（节流 + 插值）、扩展性（50+ 用户不卡顿）以及边界情况（屏幕外光标如何提示）。本节介绍多人光标的设计、技术实现、性能优化和 UX 模式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方面</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>更新频率</td>\n<td>20-30 Hz（50ms 节流）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色</td>\n<td>每用户固定，通过 ID 哈希生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>姓名标签</td>\n<td>紧凑，闲置后淡出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动画</td>\n<td>CSS transition 100ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕外</td>\n<td>边缘指示器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不活跃</td>\n<td>闲置 5 秒后淡出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级</td>\n<td>在内容之上，在弹窗之下</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>光标从本地鼠标事件到远程渲染的完整链路如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[本地 mousemove 事件] --&gt; B[节流 50ms / 20Hz]&#10;    B --&gt; C[awareness.setLocalStateField cursor]&#10;    C --&gt; D[服务器扇出广播]&#10;    D --&gt; E[远程客户端 awareness change]&#10;    E --&gt; F[transform 更新位置]&#10;    F --&gt; G[CSS transition / rAF 插值平滑]\">graph TD\n    A[本地 mousemove 事件] --&gt; B[节流 50ms / 20Hz]\n    B --&gt; C[awareness.setLocalStateField cursor]\n    C --&gt; D[服务器扇出广播]\n    D --&gt; E[远程客户端 awareness change]\n    E --&gt; F[transform 更新位置]\n    F --&gt; G[CSS transition / rAF 插值平滑]</pre><h2 id=\"光标视觉设计\">光标视觉设计</h2><p><strong>指针形状</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模拟操作系统光标。</li>\n<li>或简单的尖角形状。</li>\n<li>按用户颜色编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>姓名标签</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>跟随光标移动。</li>\n<li>显示用户名（或缩写）。</li>\n<li>使用用户颜色作为背景。</li>\n<li>紧凑显示（最多 8-12 个字符）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 HTML</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"&lt;div className=&quot;cursor&quot; style={{ left: x, top: y }}&gt;&#10;  &lt;Pointer color={color} /&gt;&#10;  &lt;span className=&quot;name&quot; style={{ background: color }}&gt;&#10;    {name}&#10;  &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;div className=\"cursor\" style={{ left: x, top: y }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Pointer color={color} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;span className=\"name\" style={{ background: color }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/div></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".cursor {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;  pointer-events: none;&#10;  transition: transform 100ms ease;&#10;  z-index: 1000;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.cursor .name {&#10;  margin-left: 12px;&#10;  padding: 2px 6px;&#10;  border-radius: 4px;&#10;  font-size: 11px;&#10;  color: white;&#10;  white-space: nowrap;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  pointer-events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: transform </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cursor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> .name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin-left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  border-radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">11</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">white</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  white-space</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nowrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"颜色分配\">颜色分配</h2><p><strong>每用户稳定颜色</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const COLORS = [&#10;  &#39;#FF6B6B&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#4ECDC4&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#45B7D1&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#FFA07A&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#98D8C8&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#F7DC6F&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#BB8FCE&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#85C1E2&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#FFB347&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#B19CD9&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#FF7F50&#39;,&#10;  &#39;#90EE90&#39;,&#10;];&#10;&#10;function userColor(userId) {&#10;  let hash = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; userId.length; i++) {&#10;    hash = (hash &lt;&lt; 5) - hash + userId.charCodeAt(i);&#10;  }&#10;  return COLORS[Math.abs(hash) % COLORS.length];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const COLORS = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#FF6B6B',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#4ECDC4',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#45B7D1',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#FFA07A',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#98D8C8',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#F7DC6F',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#BB8FCE',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#85C1E2',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#FFB347',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#B19CD9',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#FF7F50',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '#90EE90',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function userColor(userId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let hash = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let i = 0; i &#x3C; userId.length; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hash = (hash &#x3C;&#x3C; 5) - hash + userId.charCodeAt(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return COLORS[Math.abs(hash) % COLORS.length];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同一用户始终显示相同颜色。</li>\n<li>颜色之间有足够区分度（HSL 空间分离）。</li>\n<li>对色盲用户友好（足够对比度）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"坐标系统\">坐标系统</h2><p><strong>页面相对坐标</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"{ x: e.pageX, y: e.pageY }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{ x: e.pageX, y: e.pageY }</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>追踪滚动感知的位置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>视口相对坐标</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"{ x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{ x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY }</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>不感知滚动。</li>\n<li>需要根据各用户滚动位置调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>容器相对坐标</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;{ x: e.clientX - rect.left, y: e.clientY - rect.top }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ x: e.clientX - rect.left, y: e.clientY - rect.top }</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>相对于特定元素。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>如何选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文档应用：使用页面相对坐标。</li>\n<li>白板应用：使用画布相对坐标。</li>\n<li>用户滚动位置不同时需要进行坐标转换。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"节流处理\">节流处理</h2><p><strong>以 20 Hz（50ms）更新</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { throttle } from &#39;lodash&#39;;&#10;&#10;const updateCursor = throttle((e) =&gt; {&#10;  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;cursor&#39;, {&#10;    x: e.pageX,&#10;    y: e.pageY,&#10;  });&#10;}, 50);&#10;&#10;document.addEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, updateCursor);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { throttle } from 'lodash';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const updateCursor = throttle((e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('cursor', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x: e.pageX,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y: e.pageY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, 50);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>document.addEventListener('mousemove', updateCursor);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>更高频率</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>60 Hz 看起来很丝滑但带宽消耗高。</li>\n<li>20 Hz 配合平滑动画通常已足够。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"平滑动画\">平滑动画</h2><p><strong>无动画的问题</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光标在 20 Hz 下逐帧跳动。</li>\n<li>视觉上有卡顿感。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>CSS transition 方案</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".cursor {&#10;  transition: transform 100ms ease;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: transform </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 通过 transform 更新位置&#10;element.style.transform = `translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 通过 transform 更新位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>element.style.transform = `translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器在 100ms 内自动动画。</li>\n<li>接近流畅的视觉效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>插值方案</strong>（进阶）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 向目标位置线性插值&#10;function animate() {&#10;  const target = remoteCursor;&#10;  current.x = lerp(current.x, target.x, 0.2);&#10;  current.y = lerp(current.y, target.y, 0.2);&#10;  cursor.style.transform = `translate(${current.x}px, ${current.y}px)`;&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(animate);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 向目标位置线性插值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function animate() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const target = remoteCursor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  current.x = lerp(current.x, target.x, 0.2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  current.y = lerp(current.y, target.y, 0.2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cursor.style.transform = `translate(${current.x}px, ${current.y}px)`;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  requestAnimationFrame(animate);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>即使更新频率低也能保持流畅。</li>\n<li>60 fps 渲染。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"屏幕外光标\">屏幕外光标</h2><p><strong>当用户光标在视口外时</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function isOffscreen(x, y, viewport) {&#10;  return x &lt; viewport.left || x &gt; viewport.right || y &lt; viewport.top || y &gt; viewport.bottom;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function isOffscreen(x, y, viewport) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return x &#x3C; viewport.left || x > viewport.right || y &#x3C; viewport.top || y > viewport.bottom;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>边缘指示器</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  isOffscreen(cursor) &amp;&amp; (&#10;    &lt;EdgeIndicator direction={getDirection(cursor, viewport)} color={user.color} name={user.name} /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  isOffscreen(cursor) &#x26;&#x26; (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;EdgeIndicator direction={getDirection(cursor, viewport)} color={user.color} name={user.name} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>视觉效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在屏幕边缘显示箭头指向光标方向。</li>\n<li>点击可跳转到该用户位置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"闲置淡出\">闲置淡出</h2><p><strong>光标超过 5 秒不移动时淡出</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".cursor {&#10;  opacity: 1;&#10;  transition: opacity 500ms;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.cursor.idle {&#10;  opacity: 0.3;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: opacity </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cursor.idle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"let idleTimer;&#10;function onCursorUpdate() {&#10;  cursor.classList.remove(&#39;idle&#39;);&#10;  clearTimeout(idleTimer);&#10;  idleTimer = setTimeout(() =&gt; cursor.classList.add(&#39;idle&#39;), 5000);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let idleTimer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function onCursorUpdate() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cursor.classList.remove('idle');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  clearTimeout(idleTimer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  idleTimer = setTimeout(() => cursor.classList.add('idle'), 5000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>UX 效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>减少闲置用户的视觉干扰。</li>\n<li>移动时重新激活显示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"断开连接处理\">断开连接处理</h2><p><strong>用户离开时光标消失</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"provider.awareness.on(&#39;change&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  const states = provider.awareness.getStates();&#10;  // 移除不在 states 中的用户光标&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.on('change', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const states = provider.awareness.getStates();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 移除不在 states 中的用户光标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>淡出效果</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".cursor.leaving {&#10;  opacity: 0;&#10;  transition: opacity 300ms;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cursor.leaving</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: opacity </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"点击指示器\">点击指示器</h2><p><strong>显示其他用户的点击动作</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"provider.awareness.on(&#39;change&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  states.forEach((state) =&gt; {&#10;    if (state.click) {&#10;      showRipple(state.click.x, state.click.y, state.user.color);&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;document.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;click&#39;, {&#10;    x: e.pageX,&#10;    y: e.pageY,&#10;    time: Date.now(),&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.on('change', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  states.forEach((state) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (state.click) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      showRipple(state.click.x, state.click.y, state.user.color);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('click', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x: e.pageX,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y: e.pageY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    time: Date.now(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在点击位置显示涟漪动画。</li>\n<li>逐渐淡出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"选择区域与范围\">选择区域与范围</h2><p><strong>显示其他用户的文本选择</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  others.map(&#10;    (o) =&gt;&#10;      o.selection &amp;&amp; &lt;SelectionOverlay key={o.id} from={o.selection.from} to={o.selection.to} color={o.user.color} /&gt;,&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  others.map(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (o) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      o.selection &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;SelectionOverlay key={o.id} from={o.selection.from} to={o.selection.to} color={o.user.color} />,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>视觉效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在选中文本上显示半透明矩形。</li>\n<li>使用用户颜色。</li>\n<li>在末尾显示姓名标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h2><p><strong>100 用户 × 30 Hz = 每秒 3000 条消息</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务器带宽压力大。</li>\n<li>优化方向：</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1. 提高节流阈值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>10-15 Hz 也可接受。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 压缩数据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只发送变化的部分（Delta）。</li>\n<li>或批量发送。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 服务器扇出</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Redis 发布/订阅。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 空间分区</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只发送视口区域内的光标。</li>\n<li>类似游戏中的区域裁剪。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"移动端适配\">移动端适配</h2><p><strong>触屏设备没有光标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>移动端跳过光标显示？</li>\n<li>替代方案：显示&quot;点击&quot;指示器。</li>\n<li>显示更为克制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>或在触摸时显示光标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>点击时短暂高亮。</li>\n<li>显示用户在哪个位置活跃。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"z-index-层级\">Z-index 层级</h2><p><strong>光标必须在内容之上</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".cursor {&#10;  z-index: 1000;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>但在弹窗之下</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".modal {&#10;  z-index: 2000;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.modal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>拖拽/选择操作期间</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>临时降低自己的光标层级（不阻碍用户操作）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"无障碍设计\">无障碍设计</h2><p><strong>屏幕阅读器</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不播报远程光标（纯视觉功能）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>键盘用户</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光标非核心 UX（鼠标驱动）。</li>\n<li>提供替代的在线感知 UI（在线用户列表）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>高对比度主题</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确保光标在高对比度主题下可见。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"现代工具\">现代工具</h2><p><strong>Liveblocks</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { useOthers } from &#39;@liveblocks/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function Cursors() {&#10;  const others = useOthers();&#10;  return others.map((o) =&gt; &lt;Cursor key={o.connectionId} cursor={o.presence.cursor} user={o.info} /&gt;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useOthers } from '@liveblocks/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Cursors() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const others = useOthers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return others.map((o) => &#x3C;Cursor key={o.connectionId} cursor={o.presence.cursor} user={o.info} />);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>内置节流和平滑动画</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>PartyKit</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提供类似的 React hooks。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Yjs awareness</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更底层。</li>\n<li>需要手动设置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>1. 不做节流</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>100 Hz 的 mousemove → 服务器过载。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 不做动画</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>视觉卡顿。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 使用固定定位坐标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不感知滚动位置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 所有用户相同颜色</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>造成混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 断开后不消失</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产生幽灵光标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 姓名标签太大</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>视觉杂乱。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 节流 50ms（20 Hz）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最佳平衡点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. CSS transition 平滑动画</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无需手动动画逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 稳定的每用户颜色</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过用户 ID 哈希。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 紧凑的姓名标签</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最多 8-12 个字符。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 闲置淡出</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>5 秒不移动则淡出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 测试 50+ 用户场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>检验性能边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"真实案例\">真实案例</h2><p><strong>Figma</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流畅的光标 + 姓名。</li>\n<li>点击涟漪效果。</li>\n<li>点击后视角跟随。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Google Docs</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>行内文本光标。</li>\n<li>颜色编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Notion</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>低调的光标。</li>\n<li>完整的在线用户头像列表。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Liveblocks 演示</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>业界最佳的多人光标实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多人光标是协作应用中最直观的功能——实时看到其他用户让产品感觉鲜活。视觉设计包括指针形状（或尖角）加紧凑姓名标签（8-12 字符）跟随光标，使用用户颜色作为背景。颜色通过哈希用户 ID 到调色板索引实现稳定分配（12 种有区分度且可访问的颜色）。坐标系统：文档应用使用页面相对（滚动感知），固定 UI 使用视口相对，画布/白板使用容器相对，不同用户滚动位置需要坐标转换。节流到 20 Hz（50ms），60 Hz 丝滑但带宽高。平滑动画使用 CSS transition 100ms ease 配合 transform，或使用 requestAnimationFrame 进行线性插值实现进阶效果。屏幕外光标使用边缘指示器箭头加点击跳转。闲置 5 秒后淡出减少视觉干扰，移动时重新激活。断开时从状态列表中移除并淡出 300ms。点击指示器在点击位置显示涟漪动画。性能方面 100 用户 × 30 Hz 压力大——可提高节流阈值到 10-15 Hz、压缩发送 Delta、Redis 发布/订阅扇出、空间分区只发视口区域。移动端触屏无光标可用点击指示替代。Z-index 设置为 1000 在内容之上但低于弹窗 2000。无障碍方面不通过屏幕阅读器播报，键盘用户使用替代在线感知 UI，确保高对比度可见。现代工具 Liveblocks React hooks 内置节流动画，PartyKit 类似，Yjs awareness 较底层需手动配置。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多人光标","id":"多人光标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"光标视觉设计","id":"光标视觉设计"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色分配","id":"颜色分配"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标系统","id":"坐标系统"},{"level":2,"text":"节流处理","id":"节流处理"},{"level":2,"text":"平滑动画","id":"平滑动画"},{"level":2,"text":"屏幕外光标","id":"屏幕外光标"},{"level":2,"text":"闲置淡出","id":"闲置淡出"},{"level":2,"text":"断开连接处理","id":"断开连接处理"},{"level":2,"text":"点击指示器","id":"点击指示器"},{"level":2,"text":"选择区域与范围","id":"选择区域与范围"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化","id":"性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端适配","id":"移动端适配"},{"level":2,"text":"Z-index 层级","id":"z-index-层级"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍设计","id":"无障碍设计"},{"level":2,"text":"现代工具","id":"现代工具"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"真实案例","id":"真实案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Awareness 与在线感知（Presence）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/awareness-and-presence"},"next":{"title":"选择与高亮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/selection-and-highlighting"}}